This file lists the third-party components this service depends on and the
compliance posture behind each choice. It is derived from the dependencies that
are actually packaged into kb-api/target/kb-rag-server.jar, not from a wish list:
every entry below was checked against the published pom or jar manifest of the
exact version this project pins. It must be kept in sync whenever a dependency
is added, removed or its license terms change (see requirements doc 12.1).

Reproduce the packaged set with:

    mvn -B -ntp -DskipTests package
    unzip -l kb-api/target/kb-rag-server.jar | grep BOOT-INF/lib/

